---
const heroImage = '/images/products/10161-charol-azul-marino_7.webp';
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-br from-[#FBF8F1] to-bone text-ink">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute right-[6%] top-1/2 size-[520px] -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-sun/40 blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-[1240px] items-center gap-12 px-8 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:gap-16">

    <!-- Column 1: text -->
    <div>
      <p class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-ink">
        <span class="h-[3px] w-9 bg-sun"></span>
       «Comodidad que no puedes dejar de caminar»
      </p>
      <h1 class="mb-6 max-w-xl font-display text-5xl font-medium leading-[1.02] md:text-7xl">
        La que de amarillo se viste, 
        <span class="underline decoration-sun decoration-[6px] underline-offset-[6px]"> en su belleza confía</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mb-9 max-w-md text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Calzado de diseño y fabricación propia, pensado para acompañarte todo el día.
      </p>
      <a href="/products" class="inline-block bg-sun px-9 py-4 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-[#ffd74a]">
        Ver colección
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2: image -->
    <div class="relative mx-auto h-[320px] w-full max-w-[340px] lg:mr-7 lg:h-[400px] lg:max-w-[360px] lg:justify-self-end">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 -translate-y-5 translate-x-5 rounded-t-full bg-sun" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-t-full border border-[#EADFC9] bg-linear-to-b from-white to-[#FFF4CC]">
        <img src={heroImage} alt="Sandalia negra de tacón ancho con suela amarilla" class="size-full object-contain mix-blend-multiply" />
      </div>

      <div class="absolute -left-4 bottom-11 flex items-center gap-2.5 border border-[#EADFC9] bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[13px] shadow-lg lg:-left-8">
        <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-sun"></span>
        Suela amarilla antiderrapante
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>